{
  "description": "围栏对拍：页面 → 本机的 ```send 围栏提取。围栏里装的是工具调用 JSON（扩展提取后再解析成 tool/arguments，围栏解析本身只管取正文）；一次回答可以排多块，按出现顺序全取；```ask 是网页向人举手，另走 parseAskFence。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "有效围栏",
      "input": "先等一下：\n```send\n{\"tool\": \"fs_read_file\", \"arguments\": {\"path\": \"README.md\"}}\n```\n然后继续。",
      "expectedCalls": ["{\"tool\": \"fs_read_file\", \"arguments\": {\"path\": \"README.md\"}}"]
    },
    {
      "name": "多行工具调用（pretty JSON 也认，解析归上一层）",
      "input": "```send\n{\n  \"tool\": \"fs_read_file\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"path\": \"README.md\"\n  }\n}\n```",
      "expectedCalls": [
        "{\n  \"tool\": \"fs_read_file\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"path\": \"README.md\"\n  }\n}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "一次排多块：全取，按顺序",
      "input": "```send\n{\"tool\": \"a\", \"arguments\": {}}\n```\n中间的话\n```send\n{\"tool\": \"b\", \"arguments\": {}}\n```",
      "expectedCalls": [
        "{\"tool\": \"a\", \"arguments\": {}}",
        "{\"tool\": \"b\", \"arguments\": {}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "普通代码块不算围栏",
      "input": "```py\nprint('hi')\n```",
      "expectedCalls": []
    },
    {
      "name": "非 send 围栏不认",
      "input": "```note\n随手记\n```",
      "expectedCalls": []
    },
    {
      "name": "没有围栏",
      "input": "今天天气不错。",
      "expectedCalls": []
    },
    {
      "name": "围栏没闭合",
      "input": "```send\n{\"tool\": \"a\"",
      "expectedCalls": []
    }
  ]
}
